{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2048- The Perfect Fusion of Minimalist Digital Art and Strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the globally popular classic puzzle game, slide blocks with fingertips and challenge the ultimate goal of &quot;2048&quot; by merging the same numbers! The rules are simple yet full of depth, and each step requires careful planning, testing your logical thinking and spatial strategy abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swipe the screen to collide and merge blocks of the same number (2+2=4, 4+4=8...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each operation generates new numbers, and the game ends when the chessboard is filled</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate high scores to challenge global rankings and unlock rare achievement badges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ba Casual players: 3-minute quick game, commuting tool to relieve boredom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ba Strategy enthusiast: Deep computing planning for optimal merging path</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ba Achievement collection control: 20+hidden challenges waiting to be unlocked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you break through the ultimate barrier of 2048? Join this Zen game in the digital world and create infinite possibilities with wisdom</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686610?t=1759979301","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686610/31aa1ad1cae7f6b9c6f75cef26677719a533b595/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759979301","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686610/936b3a5c3258e6e8e6bd0e47c1d97b9688b01878/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759979301","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686610/936b3a5c3258e6e8e6bd0e47c1d97b9688b01878/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759979301","categories":[{"descripti